{% case_body "The backbone." %}
  <p>Four years with a personal trainer. Every block starts the same way: a PDF lands, gets pasted into a Google Doc, tidied, dated, then updated set by set for twelve weeks. New plan, start again. <strong>Consistency and tracking</strong> are the whole game, and the tooling was the weak link. So I <em>built the fix</em>.</p>
{% endcase_body %}

