{% case_body "How I build it." %}
  <p>Train, notice what's clunky, <strong>voice-note it</strong>. The notes go into Claude Plan, the fix goes through Claude Code, GitHub and Supabase, and it's usually live the same day. If it needs design: a quick Figma wireframe, a ChatGPT image pass for options, then into Claude Code as the starting point.</p>
  <div class="flow" aria-label="The build loop">
    <span class="flow__step">Voice note</span><span class="flow__arr">→</span>
    <span class="flow__step">Claude Plan</span><span class="flow__arr">→</span>
    <span class="flow__step">Claude Code</span><span class="flow__arr">→</span>
    <span class="flow__step">GitHub</span><span class="flow__arr">→</span>
    <span class="flow__step">Supabase</span><span class="flow__arr">→</span>
    <span class="flow__step flow__step--ship">Ship</span>
  </div>
{% endcase_body %}

{% case_body "The brand." %}
